          "caption": "Scope and content:  This is a wide angle view. Full caption: [Street level view, looking down Market Street from Van Ness Avenue east towards the bay. The prominent building in the center at Powell and Market is the James Flood Building whose insides were gutted out by fire. In the distance, are the Mutual Savings Bank( Kearney and Market Streets) and The Cluas Spreckels Building (Thrid and Market Streets). Across Market Street from the James Flood Building is the Emporium and at rhe extreme right is the The Mint building intact .]\nGeneral notes:  This photograph was most likely printed in the 1950s.",
